tools.example:
1. Press T and drag a text box across the banner.
2. Type the headline, select it with Ctrl+A and set the font in the options bar.
3. Ctrl+Enter to commit.

JSX equivalent:
var l = app.activeDocument.artLayers.add();
l.kind = LayerKind.TEXT;
l.textItem.contents = "Spring sale";
l.textItem.size = 48;
